  unitName: Earth Blade Duran
  unitId: 30634
  unitNumber: 1045
  description: Wielder of the Sacred Blade. Long before the great war with the gods
    began, a demon appeared in Grand Gaia. Taken by surprise, the gods attempted
    to slay it, but the wounded demon got away and subsequently attacked a town nearby.
    It was then when a goddess appeared and bestowed the Sacred Blade upon the hero
    Duran, who finally defeated the demon. However, the Sacred Blade held powers
    that frightened even the gods, which means that Duran was quite the formidable
    human if he was able to wield it.
  summonDesc: If you like, I will defeat<br>our enemies by your side.<br>After all,
    that is my role.
  fusionDesc: This is too easy,<br>and therein lies its faults.<br>I advise you don't
    overdo it.
